      "id": "ecfG",
      "code_hash": "e932f1de36c5ca80ac589259123796cb",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"execucao-do-solver-cp-sat\">Execu\u00e7\u00e3o do Solver (CP-SAT)</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Ap\u00f3s a defini\u00e7\u00e3o de todas as vari\u00e1veis, restri\u00e7\u00f5es e objetivos de otimiza\u00e7\u00e3o, o solver CP-SAT procura uma solu\u00e7\u00e3o v\u00e1lida.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">O algoritmo busca encontrar um hor\u00e1rio que satisfa\u00e7a 100% das restri\u00e7\u00f5es obrigat\u00f3rias e minimize as penaliza\u00e7\u00f5es definidas.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
